# loom and C11 (verus/WEAKMEM.md): the store is the owner word's only
# write in shipped code (tests/loom/tests/access.rs: class/table.rs writes
# no other atomic, and only it names the owner words' invariants,
# `owner_invs`), so every load ordered after it in happens-before reads
# `arena` (write-read coherence, [intro.races]); excluding a load not so
# ordered is the reader's premise (`load_u16_at`'s witness). Under the
# watermark's `Release` store the claimer's `Acquire` load supplies that
# order; the free and watermark models check it on copies of the
# `SlabTable` steps (tests/loom/tests/pins.rs). The GenMC watermark cases
# check it on a copy too: `take_group`'s owner-word store, written onto
# `core`'s atomic and pinned to this body's store (tests/genmc/watermark.rs,
# `GENMC_PINS`), which the readers' `Acquire` watermark load orders before
# their owner loads.
